{"id":"58681e11-4534-41e7-9124-2310665bfa17","object":"chat.completion","created":1785035267,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"implementation\": \"def solve(case):\\n    nodes = case['nodes']\\n    core = case['core_distance']\\n    dist_edges = case['distances']\\n    \\n    # Build all mutual reachability edges from given distances\\n    edges = []\\n    for u, v, d in dist_edges:\\n        # Canonicalize endpoints\\n        if u > v:\\n            u, v = v, u\\n        # Mutual reachability\\n        w = max(core[u], core[v], d)\\n        edges.append((w, u, v))\\n    \\n    # Sort by weight, then first endpoint, then second endpoint\\n    edges.sort(key=lambda x: (x[0], x[1], x[2]))\\n    \\n    # Union-Find\\n    parent = {n: n for n in nodes}\\n    rank = {n: 0 for n in nodes}\\n    \\n    def find(x):\\n        while parent[x] != x:\\n            parent[x] = parent[parent[x]]\\n            x = parent[x]\\n        return x\\n    \\n    def union(x, y):\\n        xr, yr = find(x), find(y)\\n        if xr == yr:\\n            return False\\n        if rank[xr] < rank[yr]:\\n            parent[xr] = yr\\n        elif rank[xr] > rank[yr]:\\n            parent[yr] = xr\\n        else:\\n            parent[yr] = xr\\n            rank[xr] += 1\\n        return True\\n    \\n    mst = []\\n    total = 0.0\\n    for w, u, v in edges:\\n        if union(u, v):\\n            mst.append([u, v, w])\\n            total += w\\n            if len(mst) == len(nodes) - 1:\\n                break\\n    \\n    if len(mst) != len(nodes) - 1:\\n        raise ValueError('Graph is disconnected; cannot form MST')\\n    \\n    return {'mst_edges': mst, 'total_weight': total}\\n\"\n}","reasoning_content":"We need to produce a Python function `solve(case)` that, given a payload with nodes, core_distance dict, and distances list, computes the MST of the mutual reachability graph. The output must be a dict with \"mst_edges\" (